---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import WavlakePodcastPlayer from '../components/WavlakePodcastPlayer.astro';
import NpubBadge from "../components/NpubBadge.astro";

import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
<h1>🔥Small Batch Steve's Seasonings🔥</h1>
<br>
<iframe data-testid="embed-iframe" style="border-radius:12px" src="https://www.takemysats.com/small-batch-steve" width="95%" height="800" frameBorder="3" allowfullscreen="" clipboard-write; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy"></iframe><br>
<a href="https://smallbatchsteve.printful.me/">MERCH SHOP LINK</a><br>

<h2>RECIPES/RECETTS</h2>
<p>These are recipes we have made and enjoy<br>
<ul>
<li>Sauces: <i>Instant BBQ, Ooh Wee Ranch, Ooh Wee Sauce</i></li>
<li>Meats: <i>BBQ Pulled Pork</i></li>
<li>Sides: <i>Cowbowy Corn, Air Fryer Hot Wing Brussels Sprouts, Daddy Chips</i></li>
<li>Favorites: <i>Beef Brisket, Baby Back Ribs, Air Fryer Roasted Chicken, Oven Egg Bites</i></li>
</ul>
<h2>OUR RECOMMENDATIONS</h2>
<h2>BUTTERS + BARS + CANDLES + SOAPS + MEATS + SATS</h3>
These are producers in the growing bitcoin marketplace. We love to support good, family-run causes. Contact us to get included!
<ul>
<li><a href="https://www.bitcoinbeans.co?ref=shop.sbasp.com">Bitcoin Beans</a> - Proof of Cacao! Serious about pure authentic superfoods.</li>
<li><a href="https://sats.coffee?ref=shop.sbasp.com">Satoshi Coffee Co.</a> - Proof of work high-quality roasters!</li>
<li><a href="https://www.etsy.com/shop/DaddyandMeFarms?ref=shop.sbasp.com">DaddyandMeFarms</a> - Wonderful handmade products! Love the unique soaps and kid friendly.</li>
<li><a href="https://www.oshigood.us">Oshi: Handcrafted, small batch pecan butter, date bars and chocolates (!)</a> - If you have the means, this is a treat!</li>
<li><a href="https://ketolish.us/">Ketolish.us</a>- Give their Hatch Green Chili jerky it received a 10,000 OOHWEE rating from our reviewers. Radically Reclaim Your Health With Real Food!</li>
<li><a href="https://thebullishbitcoiner.com/">The Bullish Bitcoiner - apps, market research and development</a></li>
</ul>
<WavlakePodcastPlayer
  title="News & Guidance — Powered by Wavlake & SmallBatchSteve"
  height="400px"
/>
<div style="max-width:75%;">
  <img src="/ss2-1.jpg" alt="BATCH2jar" style="width:75%; height:auto; display:block; border-radius:8px;"/>
</div>
